accessWidener v2 intermediary

# The 26.x generation of the modern widener, and it is deliberately EMPTY.
#
# Loom refuses to remap a widener onto these nodes at all:
#   Cannot remap access widener from namespace 'official'. Expected: 'intermediary'
# which is what an identity mapping does to the remap -- there is no obfuscation to undo, so the
# two namespaces are the same and the remap has nothing to work from.
#
# Nothing is lost by leaving it empty: it is the same two members as modern.accesswidener, and if
# the compiler needs them on 26.x it will say so. Declared anyway so the build script has a file
# to point at and the three generations stay uniform.